## Defect found and fixed by the focused tests

`CloudRewriteValidatorTests.Sensitive_token_mutation_is_rejected` initially FAILED for the Windows-path case
(`C:\Apps\Fluent` -> `C:\Apps\NyxFlow` was accepted). Root cause: the sensitive-token regex had been written with a
mangled escape, producing `(?:[A-Za-z]:\|\\)` (a literal pipe) instead of `(?:[A-Za-z]:\\|\\\\)`, so Windows paths were
never extracted and therefore never protected. This was a genuine P-011 gap. The regex was corrected and the test now
passes; the case remains in the suite as a regression guard.

