## Second repair cycle

A code review returned FAIL on a blocking defect: the cloud validator call sat outside the orchestrator guard, so a
`RegexMatchTimeoutException` would have destroyed the dictation instead of falling back to the exact local text. That
defect, plus a validator drift gap (scheme, UNC, and proper-noun tokens unprotected on the cloud path), an ambiguous
Unix-path regex, a backend DI captive dependency, frozen cloud options, and an unguarded outbound provider call were all
repaired. Final figures: focused Rewrite `~Cloud` 39/39, Integration `~Cloud` 4/4, Backend 29/29, complete suite
**256/256**, Release build 0 warnings and 0 errors.
